LEGACYGUARD
The Living Engineering Memory & Incident Resolution Harness
“When the engineer leaves, the knowledge doesn't.”

One-line pitch
LEGACYGUARD continuously understands a company's software, preserves its engineering knowledge and historical incidents, detects documentation and knowledge gaps, and uses verified internal or external evidence to help engineers diagnose and resolve new failures safely.

