2. The four major capabilities
I would structure the entire product around four pillars.

Pillar A — Living Software Understanding
Understand existing and legacy software.

Pillar B — Institutional Engineering Memory
Remember incidents, fixes, decisions and relevant engineering expertise.

Pillar C — Incident Resolution Intelligence
Use historical knowledge first, external knowledge second, and human escalation when evidence is insufficient.

Pillar D — Continuous Software/SDLC Continuity
Keep documentation and knowledge synchronized as software evolves.

